Full Dataset Export (.tar.gz)
sanity dataset export production backup.tar.gz

ADD BLOGS
npx tsx gemini/uploadBlog.ts

Restore Backup
sanity dataset import backup.tar.gz production


Full Backup
sanity dataset export production backup.tar.gz